:: OC Nikolai School Locker Room Shower Share [nobr]

/* Written by: Oryan */
Class is over and all you can think of is getting to a shower before a line forms, <span style="color:LightCoral">no such luck.</span> Most of the showers are already taken, the curtains pulled shut with the telltale sounds of splashing and singing, mostly off-key. You check the remaining ones out of hope only to confirm that they are all busted. One’s sputtering water like a bad cough, another is just dripping, and the last is practically falling apart with the showerhead hanging with no water coming out. <span style="color:Yellow">You can’t help but wonder how such a fancy school can constantly have half the showers out of commission.</span> <br>

<<set _ad to [
    {
        Name: "Kohler",
        State: {
            Mouth: "Frown",
            Brows: "Angry",
        },
    },
    {
        Name: "Player",
        State: {
            Outfit: "Towel",
            Blush: 1,
            Mouth: "Frown",
        },
    },
]>>
<<ad _ad>>

<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Coach Kohler</span> claps his hands together by the door, causing everyone to jump. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Alright, I don’t want anyone dillydallying around waiting for a shower. If yours isn’t working, find one that is. We haven’t got all day!”</span> <br>
<br>
Before you can even think about what to do, you feel his hands on your back pushing you forward towards a running shower. You stumble, almost tripping over your own feet. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Get in there, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$Player.Name</span>! <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Castle</span>’s got one working.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Coach Kohler’s</span> voice booms in your ear. You start to protest, but it’s no use. <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: Pink">You awkwardly pull back the curtain, mumbling an apology. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Niki</span> looks up, looking briefly surprised as you practically stumble into the shower with him.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Woah! Hey, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$Player.Name</span>”</span> a small unsure smile on his face. He doesn’t seem mad at all, just surprised. You stammer out an explanation, feeling your face get hot. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Niki</span> just shrugs and turns back to the water <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“No biggie. Plenty of room.”</span> You are just trying not to make eye contact, <span style="Color: Pink">The space definitely feeling smaller than it usually does.</span> <br>

<<set _ad to [
    {
        Name: "Player",
        State: {
            Outfit: "Towel",
            Blush: 3,
            MoutH: "Frown",
        },
    },
