]>>
<<ad _ad>>

You can’t help noticing how completely relaxed <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Niki</span> seems to be despite your unexpected intrusion, <span style="Color: Pink">and you also can’t help noticing that he’s built like a professional swimmer, but what really catches your eye is just how well endowed he is. You feel your cheeks burning as you stare.</span> <br>
<br>
He notices you staring <br>
<br>

<<if $OCNikolaiSocial > 0>>
    <span style="Color: Pink">A playful glint forms in his eyes, he isn’t embarrassed, or angry, he seems to be more amused.</span> He shrugs and asks you <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Like what you see”</span> before chuckling at his own joke, it’s a friendly sound to say the least before adding a <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“But actually, relax. It’s cool. No big deal”</span> with a shrug, completely comfortable in his own skin <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Happens all the time, …so, you gonna stand there gawking all day, or you gonna actually wash?”</span> <br>

    <<set _ad to [
