    You finally manage to clear your thoughts enough to step under the water, trying to wash away the sweat and awkwardness. <span style="Color: Pink">The water is warm and feels good on your skin, but you’re still super aware of <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Niki</span> standing right next to you.</span> <br>
    <br>
    The silence between you 2 lasts for only a couple moments before <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Niki</span> speaks up, starting a casual conversation with you about anything, and helping you completely forget about your initial awkwardness. <br>
    <br>
    When you both finish showering <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Niki</span> steps out first and before you can even ask for it, he hands you your towel. You mumble out a thanks as you wrap it around your waist and step out 
    <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“No problem, see you around”</span> you watch him wrap his towel around his waist and walk away. <br>

